OL,3,GNEWSA'Doctors put my sickness down to
OL,4,Apregnancy - but it was abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fand references to abusive behaviour
OL,9,FTen years ago, Stacey Runciman was
OL,10,Fpregnant and in an abusive
OL,11,Frelationship. She never felt she could
OL,12,Fdisclose what was happening to
OL,13,Fhealthcare professionals.
OL,15,F"I was admitted into hospital when I
OL,16,Fwas pregnant because I was really
OL,17,Fpoorly and kept being sick, and no-one
OL,18,Freally asked me what was going on at
OL,19,Fhome," the 39-year-old said.
