OL,3,GNEWSA'Doctors put my sickness down to
OL,4,Apregnancy - but it was abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If they had, they would have known
OL,7,Fthat I was being sick because my
OL,8,Fex-partner had limited my food intake.
OL,9,FBut they just put it down to pregnancy
OL,10,Fsickness."
